{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dracu Riot is a Japanese-style visual novel produced by Yuzusoft, a Japanese developer of romance VNs. <br>It won numerous awards in the year of its release in Japan for its art, music, and characters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340140/extras/\u30c9\u30e9\u30af\u30ea\u30aa\u30c3\u30c8\u30ed\u30b4\uff08\u7d71\u54082\uff09.png?t=1770818084\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Special Administrative Region &quot;Aqua Eden&quot;, an artificial island off the coast of Japan, where casinos and more are legal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man heads to the island with one goal in mind: &quot;I'm gonna get laid and lose my v-card!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His unwitting friend and our protagonist, Mutsura Yuuto, came along under the assumption that it would be a simple, fun vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, on the very first day of their trip, Yuuto witnesses a kidnapping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to overlook this transgression, Yuuto takes matters into his own hands, setting off a chain of events leading to his becoming a vampire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, our newly fanged hero finds himself confined to the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbeknownst to him, his new life there is only just beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midnight city of the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires wandering it moonlit streets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuuto's unforgettable new nightlife is about to begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is the story of a city with a utopian vision- one where humans and vampires are allowed to coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340140/extras/cos01.png?t=1770818084\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1340140?t=1770818084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770818084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340140/75ddfe886d2350986e5dfb16b075687e8f2548a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770818084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340140/75ddfe886d2350986e5dfb16b075687e8f2548a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770818084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Adult content includes a few illustrations with revealing outfits and kissing.\r\nCharacters enter a relationship that is not shown on screen, but acts of which are brought up in conversation.\r\nAlso, every appearing character is over 18 years old."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dracu Riot is a Japanese-style visual novel produced by Yuzusoft, a Japanese developer of romance VNs. <br>It won numerous awards in the year of its release in Japan for its art, music, and characters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340140/extras/\u30c9\u30e9\u30af\u30ea\u30aa\u30c3\u30c8\u30ed\u30b4\uff08\u7d71\u54082\uff09.png?t=1770818084\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla